PHASE 29 — Media Buyer / Marketing Partner Dashboard, Tracking, Analytics, and Commission System

Goal:
Build a dedicated dashboard for media buyers / marketing partners who promote Habiba Nabil Arabic Academy and earn commission from paid orders.

Important:
Do not give media buyers Owner access.
Media buyers should only see their own campaign performance, attributed orders, revenue, and commissions.
They must not see private student/parent learning data.

Add a new role:
MEDIA_BUYER
or
MARKETING_PARTNER

==================================================
PART 1 — MEDIA BUYER ROLE
==================================================

Create a new role:
MEDIA_BUYER

Media Buyer can:
- Log in
- View own dashboard
- View own tracking links
- View own campaigns
- View own attributed orders
- View own commission summary
- View payout history
- Export own summary if allowed

Media Buyer cannot:
- View student private data
- View parent private data
- View homework/scenario/review/level test details
- View Owner settings
- Change pricing
- Change payment status
- Access other media buyers’ data

Routes:
- /media/dashboard
- /media/campaigns
- /media/links
- /media/orders
- /media/commissions
- /media/payouts
- /media/settings

==================================================
PART 2 — TRACKING LINKS
==================================================

Build tracking links for each media buyer.

Support:
- partner code
- referral code
- UTM source
- UTM campaign
- UTM content
- UTM medium
- coupon code optional

Example links:
https://mshabibanabil.com/pricing?partner=ahmed
https://mshabibanabil.com/pricing?utm_source=facebook&utm_campaign=kids_arabic&partner=ahmed

When a visitor lands with partner/utm data:
- Store tracking data in cookie/local storage.
- Attach tracking data to checkout order if user purchases.
- Do not overwrite tracking source too aggressively.
- Store first-touch and last-touch if practical.

Tracking fields:
- mediaBuyerId
- partnerCode
- utmSource
- utmMedium
- utmCampaign
- utmContent
- utmTerm
- landingPage
- firstTouchAt
- lastTouchAt

==================================================
PART 3 — ATTRIBUTED ORDERS
==================================================

When checkout order is created, attach attribution data.

Order attribution should include:
- mediaBuyerId
- campaignId optional
- partnerCode
- UTM data
- firstTouch / lastTouch
- selected plan
- amount
- payment status

Commission should only be calculated when:
paymentStatus = paid

Do not count:
- pending
- pending_verification
- failed
- cancelled
- refunded

If order is refunded:
- adjust commission
- mark commission as reversed or deducted
- audit log the change

==================================================
PART 4 — COMMISSION SETTINGS
==================================================

Owner can configure commission settings.

Owner page:
- /owner/settings/media-buyers
- /owner/media-buyers
- /owner/media-buyers/[id]
- /owner/media-commissions

Commission options:
- global percentage
- percentage per media buyer
- percentage per package
- fixed amount per paid order
- no commission for refunded orders
- commission approval required
- payout cycle: weekly / monthly / manual

Default:
- commissionType = percentage
- commissionRate = configurable by Owner
- calculate on paid revenue only
- approval required before payout

Package-specific commission optional:
- Single Session
- Monthly Plan
- 30-Hour Bundle

