==================================================
PART 7 — COMMISSION RECORDS
==================================================

Create commission records when payment becomes paid.

CommissionRecord:
- id
- mediaBuyerId
- checkoutOrderId
- packageName
- orderAmount
- commissionType
- commissionRate
- commissionAmount
- status: pending / approved / rejected / paid / reversed
- reason
- createdAt
- approvedAt
- paidAt
- reversedAt

PayoutRecord:
- id
- mediaBuyerId
- amount
- status
- payoutMethod optional
- note
- createdAt
- paidAt

Rules:
- Prevent duplicate commission for same order.
- Refund should reverse commission if applicable.
- Manual changes require audit log.

