- UTM data
- checkoutOrderId if available

==================================================
PART 9 — SECURITY
==================================================

Security:
- Media buyer can only see own data.
- Owner can see all.
- API routes must enforce role and ownership.
- Do not expose private student data.
- Do not expose payment provider raw payloads to media buyer.
- Do not allow media buyer to change orders or payment statuses.
- Commission changes are Owner-only.
- Audit log all commission and payout changes.

