==================================================
PART 11 — ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
==================================================

Phase is complete when:

- Owner can create media buyer account.
- Media buyer can log in.
- Media buyer gets tracking/referral links.
- Visitor tracking data is stored.
- Checkout order captures media buyer attribution.
- Paid orders generate commission records.
- Pending/failed/refunded orders do not count as payable commission.
- Owner can approve and mark commission as paid.
- Media buyer can view own dashboard only.
- Media buyer cannot access private student/parent data.
- Owner can view all media buyer reports.
- Audit log records commission changes.

Stop condition:
Stop here. Test media buyer tracking and commission before continuing.
